<title>YUGOSLAVIA: SOCCER-MACEDONIA'S HRISTOV SIGNS FOR BARNSLEY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MACEDONIA'S HRISTOV SIGNS FOR BARNSLEY.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-06-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Macedonian international Gjorgi Hristov of Yugoslav club Partizan Belgrade signed a three-year contract with newly promoted English premier league club Barnsley on Saturday.</p>
<p>Hristov, a centre-forward, leaves the Yugoslav champions to join the south Yorkshire club who have won promotion to the top tier of English football for the first time in their 110-year history.</p>
</text>
